{"4554070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Overbloom", "steam_appid": 4554070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554070/extras/24bb4ade68a8b5481f307fe94dec484e.avif?t=1780231545\" width=1544 height=168 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>❀🌺🌸Overview🌸🌺❀</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Overbloom </strong>is a real-time roguelite tower defense where you cultivate powerful plant builds, discover strange items from the past, and survive against a spreading corruption looking to consume all life on the planet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build unique setups every run, experiment with status effects, synergies and see how far your garden can go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🌸Mother Nature always gets the last laugh in this roguelite!🌸</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>❀🌺🌸Gameplay🌸🌺❀</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place plants on a grid-based board to defend the last sapling from waves of corrupted enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items that transform the battlefield, giving you an edge against enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine plant abilities to create powerful, emergent builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy as enemies evolve and grow stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as possible in increasingly hostile runs</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>❀🌺🌸Key Features🌸🌺❀</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 unique plants, each with distinct mechanics and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 starting decks, with passive abilities to suggest a certain playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 items that alter gameplay, from stat buffs to proc effects such as burning on hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally evolving runs. No two runs are the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrupted enemies that become more powerful overtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, readable pixel art designed for clarity and atmosphere</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>❀🌺🌸Accessibility🌸🌺❀</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Overbloom includes features intended to make the game more accessible to everyone. These features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind palettes for aspects of the game such as health, XP, and item rarities, designed for easy differentiation for people affected by deuteranopia, protanopia, tritanopia, or achromatopsia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of dyslexic-friendly fonts to make important information easier to read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully playable using just a mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct silhouettes for each plant, item, and enemy for clear readability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings to adjust brightness and contrast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554070/extras/f68738b367c7acd2b4b2f829d3f5c96e.avif?t=1780231545\" width=1544 height=180 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554070/extras/24bb4ade68a8b548