overtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, readable pixel art designed for clarity and atmosphere</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>❀🌺🌸Accessibility🌸🌺❀</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Overbloom includes features intended to make the game more accessible to everyone. These features include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorblind palettes for aspects of the game such as health, XP, and item rarities, designed for easy differentiation for people affected by deuteranopia, protanopia, tritanopia, or achromatopsia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of dyslexic-friendly fonts to make important information easier to read</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is fully playable using just a mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct silhouettes for each plant, item, and enemy for clear readability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settings to adjust brightness and contrast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554070/extras/f68738b367c7acd2b4b2f829d3f5c96e.avif?t=1780231545\" width=1544 height=180 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Overbloom is a real-time roguelite tower defense where you cultivate powerful plant builds, discover strange items from the past, and survive against a spreading corruption looking to consume all life on the planet!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554070/be7a37f77639ae87ec1a965ce3892739250366d4/header.jpg?t=1780231545", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4554070/a86d4ec89fe9460516050df81f5252e7543d9b81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780231545", "capsule_imagev5": "htt